sequenceDiagram
    participant Pod as Pod Startup
    participant Init as Init Container<br/>init_managed_pipelines
    participant Volume as Shared Volume<br/>/config/managed-pipelines
    participant KFP as KFP API Server
    participant TaskPod as KFP Task Pod<br/>(Component)
    participant S3 as S3-Compatible Storage<br/>HTTPS
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>In-cluster
    participant Ray as Ray Cluster<br/>(CodeFlare SDK)

    Note over Pod,KFP: Phase 1: Init Container Pipeline Staging

    Pod->>Init: Container starts
    Init->>Init: Read pre-compiled YAML from /app
    alt RELATED_IMAGE env vars set (Konflux)
        Init->>Init: Recompile pipelines with<br/>correct image references
    end
    Init->>Volume: Copy pipeline YAMLs to<br/>/config/managed-pipelines
    Volume->>KFP: KFP server reads YAMLs<br/>Registers managed pipelines

    Note over KFP,Ray: Phase 2: Pipeline Component Execution

    KFP->>TaskPod: Orchestrate component<br/>as task pod

    alt Tabular Data Loader / Dataset Download
        TaskPod->>S3: Read/Write data<br/>boto3 HTTPS<br/>Auth: AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID +<br/>AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY
        S3-->>TaskPod: Data artifacts
    end

    alt Parse & Chunk (Distributed)
        TaskPod->>K8s: Authenticate via<br/>SA token (in-cluster)
        K8s-->>TaskPod: Auth OK
        TaskPod->>Ray: Submit RayJob<br/>(CodeFlare SDK)
        Ray-->>TaskPod: Processing results
        TaskPod->>S3: Store processed chunks<br/>boto3 HTTPS
        S3-->>TaskPod: Write confirmation
    end

    alt SDG Component
        TaskPod->>TaskPod: Invoke SDG Hub SDK<br/>Generate synthetic data
        TaskPod->>S3: Store generated data<br/>boto3 HTTPS
        S3-->>TaskPod: Write confirmation
    end

    alt AutoRAG Optimization
        TaskPod->>TaskPod: Invoke ai4rag SDK<br/>Optimize RAG templates
    end

    TaskPod-->>KFP: Task complete
